  "bio": "Almazoff196 is a master of the lettering style, renowned for their impeccable skill in crafting fonts and scripts that infuse personality and elegance into each design. Based in the vibrant city of Saint Petersburg, Russia, this artist's work is a testament to their devotion to the art of tattooing, ensuring each piece resonates with the individuality of their clients. With a reputation for cleanliness that matches their artistic prowess, Almazoff196 is the go-to tattooist for anyone seeking refined lettering work in a meticulously maintained studio environment.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Saint Petersburg, Northwestern Federal District, Russia"
}